```
and then pass this `BATCH_CONFIG` while instantiating the operator?

```
create_batch = DataprocCreateBatchOperator(
        task_id="create_batch",
        project_id=PROJECT_ID,
        region=REGION,
        batch=BATCH_CONFIG,
        batch_id=BATCH_ID,
    )
```

